      "lang": "rust",
      "code": "// 标准库**没有**参数化测试语法 —— 手写循环是最常见的做法\n#[test]\nfn parses_all_cases() {\n  let cases = [\n    (\"1\", 1),\n    (\"42\", 42),\n    (\"-7\", -7),\n  ];\n  for (input, expected) in cases {\n    assert_eq!(input.parse::<i32>().unwrap(), expected, \"输入 {}\", input);\n  }\n}\n\n// 社区用 rstest 这类库补上：\n//   #[rstest]\n//   #[case(\"1\", 1)]\n//   #[case(\"42\", 42)]\n//   fn parses(#[case] input: &str, #[case] expected: i32) { … }",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki css-variables\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">// 标准库**没有**参数化测试语法 —— 手写循环是最常见的做法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">#[test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">fn</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> parses_all_cases</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">  let</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> cases </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    (</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\">\"1\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">1</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    (</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\">\"42\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">42</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">    (</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\">\"-7\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">7</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">  for</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> (input, expected) </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">in</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> cases {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">    assert_eq!</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(input</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">parse</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">::</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">i32</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">>()</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">unwrap</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(), expected, </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\">\"输入 {}\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">, input);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">// 社区用 rstest 这类库补上：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">//   #[rstest]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">//   #[case(\"1\", 1)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">//   #[case(\"42\", 42)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">//   fn parses(#[case] input: &#x26;str, #[case] expected: i32) { … }</span></span></code></pre>",
